      </div>
      <h3>Process improvement roles</h3>
      <p class="route-card__why">Improve quality and speed.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Employers.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Measured effects.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Resistance to change.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Move toward lead.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="route-card">
      <div class="route-card__top">
        <span class="route-card__n">04</span>
        <span class="chip chip--mid">Scalable with a business layer</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Quality and compliance roles</h3>
      <p class="route-card__why">Keep processes in rules.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Employers.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Clean audits.</p>
